# Trivy ignore list — configuration/misconfiguration scan only.
#
# The image CVE allowlist lives in `.trivyignore.yaml` (structured format with
# machine-enforced `expired-at` expiry). This plain-text file is referenced by
# the configuration security scan and records reviewed misconfiguration check
# IDs that should be suppressed so the scan can still flag *new* findings.
#
# Format (one ID per line):
#   AVD-KSV-0000                        # misconfiguration check ID (justify it)
#
# Guidelines:
#   - Justify every entry and keep the list as small as possible.
#
# No entries yet — every misconfiguration finding is currently reported.
